{% faq-item question="Does Parea track costs?" answer="No, Parea is focused on prompt development." /%}

{% faq-item question="Can I use both?" answer="Yes. Parea for development, Tracify for production." /%}

{% faq-item question="Which is cheaper?" answer="Parea for development; Tracify for production at scale." /%}

